{"id":938770,"title":"01｜“传统”推荐系统的局限：我的模型为什么优化不动了？","content":"推荐系统正从传统模式向生成式模型转变。传统推荐系统采用DLRM模式，通过特征工程、多级排序和多任务学习优化模型，但面临四大瓶颈：增加特征不等于更准确建模，模型加深不一定更好，更多样本难以持续学习用户偏好，增加目标函数未必增强理解。这些瓶颈源于特征工程依赖经验、复杂规律难以捕捉、新特征边际收益递减、数据噪声严重等问题。此外，过深网络易梯度消失或爆炸，长周期训练导致灾难性遗忘，多目标间存在梯度冲突。大语言模型的成功启发了新的推荐系统设计思路：直接在用户行为日志上训练，无需特征工程；模型越大效果越好；能够持续有效学习新增数据；一个模型完成多种任务。这将极大减轻算法工程师负担，并提升推荐系统的性能和灵活性。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":404855,"user_name":"muni","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2061557,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"E14FD4E324A6BB","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1f/74/f5/542fb70d.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1768996516,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":147348,"content":"是","user_name":"编辑回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1015812,"ctime":1769093555,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":404855,"utype":2}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101108201,"comment_content":"大佬，能一次性更新吗","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1015812,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/80/04/e6989d2a.jpg","nickname":"极客时间攻城狮","note":"","ucode":"E279553F00309F","race_medal":0,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":677309,"discussion_content":"是","content_length":3,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1769093555,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":8,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":404844,"user_name":"Geek_3bed1f","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4462066,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"FB43C218C5F29B","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/jxst6LianIqqC58bHGnb2HMowlm6icm4vvZJl9JVaaqr3GfebolxC8JYgm2yJoK2rHlxHCU7ib9MHWgTLq65tMqAQQtXJwuu0w4CsUKx